message: "If you use or adapt this book, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Applications and Integrations (Book 6 — The Applications & Integrations Core)"
abstract: >-
  An open, project-oriented textbook on combining electrical and electronic
  engineering into working systems: requirements, architecture, modelling,
  prototyping, verification and documentation; sensors, signal conditioning
  and data acquisition; embedded, IoT and edge-AI devices; robotics, drones
  and mechatronics; industrial automation, motor control and functional
  safety; solar PV, battery systems, electric vehicles and microgrids;
  communication links, practical signal processing and biomedical
  instrumentation; engineering software, scientific computing, machine
  learning and digital twins; and seven complete engineering projects.
  9 parts, 40 chapters and 225 computed figures, written in Markdown and
  LaTeX, with a typeset PDF and an MCP server.
authors:
